// ---- appointment read-back gate (server-side) ----
// Identification is phone-only now, so the caller's explicit yes on THIS appointment is the whole
// safeguard against touching a family member's booking. The agent reports that yes with
// appointment_confirmed=true; a call without it is refused with the exact wording to read back,
